WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.627 --> 00:00:06.214
Let’s welcome Martellus to the Gridiron Heights writer's room

00:00:09.592 --> 00:00:17.684
We’re so excited to have him executive producing and writing and directing Episode 303

00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:22.355
Just being retired, I thought it would be really funny to check into a retirement home

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:24.232
with guys who are already retired

00:00:24.232 --> 00:00:26.401
You should have Ray Lewis, like

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:30.363
“When I moved into the retirement home, crime dropped 100 percent”

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:35.452
And then I could be like

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:36.369
"Help!"

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.955
And then you could see Cutty, like, walking by in the background

00:00:38.955 --> 00:00:39.497
Yeah

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:42.250
You see him the first time, Cutty! Help!

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.210
And he just, like, peeks back in

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.462
And he’s like

00:00:45.462 --> 00:00:47.964
"Cigarette?"

00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:51.384
I’m doing all my lines first

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:54.054
You’re retired. It’s not safe for you to be on your own.

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.889
I survived a 28-3 deficit

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.223
That’s so f--cked up

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:57.724
Yeah

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:02.270
Cutty! I need heeeelp!

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:02.854
Cigarette?

00:01:02.854 --> 00:01:04.814
There we go miscommunicating again

00:01:04.814 --> 00:01:08.151
My in season record is 2,500, and I think I can beat that now

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:11.654
That’s just ridiculous

00:01:11.654 --> 00:01:14.866
"Get Out" was a great movie

00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:20.288
Retired athletes have no life

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:22.832
Yeah, it’s a full Marty episode

